# Python caches and packaging output
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.ipynb_checkpoints/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/build/
**/dist/

# QuickFIX build and runtime output
QuickFIX/build*/
QuickFIX/lib/
QuickFIX/log/
QuickFIX/store/
QuickFIX/bin/log*/
QuickFIX/bin/store*/
QuickFIX/test/pt
QuickFIX/test/at
QuickFIX/test/ut
QuickFIX/test/fix_parse_benchmark
